ps</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters.html\\\">Bolsters</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blankets.html\\\">Blankets</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/meditation.html\\\">Meditation</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/wholesale.html\\\">Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/sale.html\\\" style=\\\"color:#e07a3f\\\">Sale 🔥</a></li></ul></nav></header><section class=\\\"hero\\\"><h1>Studio-Quality Yoga Gear, Direct From the Source</h1><p>We've supplied yogis, studios and events since 1999 — manufacturing our own mats and props so you save up to 40% vs. retail, without sacrificing quality.</p><div class=\\\"hero-ctas\\\"><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats.html\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Shop Best-Selling Mats</a><a href=\\\"/wholesale.html\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\">Bulk &amp; Studio Pricing</a></div><p class=\\\"hero-note\\\">⭐ Trusted by 100,000+ customers &nbsp;•&nbsp; 60-Day Easy Returns &nbsp;•&nbsp; Family-owned since 1999</p></section><div class=\\\"trustbar\\\"><div class=\\\"container\\\"><div>🚚 Free Shipping<em>On orders $75+</em></div><div>🏭 Factory-Direct Prices<em>We make our own gear</em></div><div>↩️ 60-Day Returns<em>Shop risk-free</em></div><div>🔒 Secure Checkout<em>SSL encrypted</em></div><div>📞 Real Human Support<em>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET</em></div></div></div><section id=\\\"featured\\\"><h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Featured Products</h2><p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Our most-loved gear — chosen by studios and home yogis alike</p><div class=\\\"grid\\\"><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"thumb\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Yoga mat\\\">🧘</div><div class=\\\"card-body\\\"><span class=\\\"badge\\\">Best Seller</span><h3>1/4\\\" Extra Thick Deluxe Yoga Mat</h3><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★ <span>(1,240 reviews)</span></div><p>Superior cushioning and grip. The studio standard for over 20 years.</p><div class=\\\"price\\\">$21.95 <s>$29.95</s></div><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats.html\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Add to Cart</a></div></div><div class=\\\"c